{
  "version": 1,
  "note": "The forest roster set (`--roster forest`, crowd.md, Roster sets): Dark and Forest Creatures Pack monsters from the more_assets root in all nine slots, drawn by the stock crowd with their own materials (Standard converted to URP Lit with their glow maps; no typeColors dye), each in one pack colourway so the types tell apart by the pack's own colours. Each type keeps a slot id, so the choreography needs no change; the hero stays the default's. Heights fit the slot's choreography radius (roster.json in Choreography/Data), which a set doesn't change: the wolf and spider are long or wide for theirs and overlap a little. `hide` names prefab children the baker removes (the Wererat carries all three weapons; it keeps the sword). `impactBone` names the bones whose speed peak is the impact, for the clip annotator (`demo3d unity AnnotateClips -roster forest`), where the fastest end bone is another (a tail). The Demon Wolf has no walk, so its walk role is its in-place run. `glow` scales a type's glow-map emission at bake (ps-f8a.4): the wolf's spikes, the treant's, golem's and dragon's large glowing areas competed with the effects, so they are held under 1 while the small eyes keep the pack's 1.1.",
